1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:04,300
Delhi and the NCR sprawling around it.

2
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:09,450
Here, in every neighbourhood, every day, one need is common — medicine.

3
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:13,600
But medicine that is genuine, prescribed by your doctor,

4
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:17,050
and also available at a good discount — that's not easy to find.

5
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:21,000
Born from this very need, Jan Seva Dawa Bazaar came to life.

6
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,550
Jan Seva Dawa Bazaar is a retail pharmacy chain.

7
00:00:24,950 --> 00:00:29,350
The company retails prescription medicines and healthcare products,

8
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:33,300
through its branch network across Delhi NCR and Gurugram.

9
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,350
Every medicine's journey begins at the stock room.

10
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:41,950
Procurement is direct from manufacturers and authorized distributors, in bulk quantity.

11
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:48,500
For every incoming consignment, the batch number, manufacturing date and expiry are recorded at entry.

12
00:00:48,950 --> 00:00:50,800
Stock storage follows strict rules.

13
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:55,000
Temperature-sensitive products are kept separately, in controlled storage.

14
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:59,450
Near-expiry stock is pulled out before it ever reaches the shelf.

15
00:00:59,850 --> 00:01:02,150
Every shelf is arranged category-wise —

16
00:01:02,550 --> 00:01:07,650
Cardiac, Diabetes, Thyroid, Dermatology, Orthopedic, Pediatric.

17
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,800
Over 15,000 SKUs at every branch.

18
00:01:12,150 --> 00:01:15,800
At the counter, a registered pharmacist verifies every prescription.

19
00:01:16,250 --> 00:01:19,450
Scheduled medicines are issued only against a valid prescription.

20
00:01:19,850 --> 00:01:24,000
At billing, every item's batch and expiry are checked again.

21
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:28,650
Direct procurement cuts out the middle layers of the distribution chain.

22
00:01:29,050 --> 00:01:32,000
The company passes these savings on in its pricing —

23
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:35,000
a flat 20% off the printed MRP.

24
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:38,350
Today this system runs across 40+ branches,

25
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:43,650
and customers who can't reach the store get their order through home delivery.

26
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:50,250
Very soon there will be 100+ branches, making service easy for every home.

27
00:01:50,650 --> 00:01:54,250
The company's vision is to keep growing the network, step by step,

28
00:01:54,700 --> 00:01:59,100
so that the right medicine, at a lower cost, reaches more families.
